	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S[alutem] d[ico].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Recepi, quae misisti accepta a <persName ref="p8377">M. Hentzio</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p8377">Martin Hentius</persName>.</note> <placeName ref="l869">Trans<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sylvano</placeName>,<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Die von <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> mit seinem Brief vom 24. Juni an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> (oben <ref target="file11982">Nr. 1935</ref>) mitgesandte Beilage, ein Brief von <persName ref="p8377">Martin Hentius</persName> vom 3. Januar 1544, ist nicht erhalten.</note> ac ingentes ago tibi, <persName ref="p8418">Myconi</persName> colendissime, gratias <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>pro fide tua et diligentia.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Cuperem autem a te <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>intelligere, qua via aut quo modo literas ad ipsum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>rescribere, imo mittere<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">imo mittere <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> possem.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sunt enim maximae causae, ob quas <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>illi omnino scribendum erit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Beneficentiam, quam <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>praestitisti monacho illi<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Unbekannt. Vgl. oben <ref target="file11982">Nr. 1935</ref> mit Anm. 3.</note> nuper a me commendato, rependet, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>qui omnium bonorum remunerator<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Vgl. z.B. Cassiodor, Variarum libri duodecim 10, 16 (<bibl>CChr-L</bibl> XCVI 399, 17); Thomas von Aquin, In symbolum apostolorum, praefatio (Vorrede) (S. Thomae Aquinatis opuscula theologica, Bd. 2, hg. v. Raymundi M. Spiazzi O. P., Rom 1954, S. 191-217, bes. 193).</note> est fidelissimus <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>et liberalissimus.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Amo et iuvo <persName ref="p8009">Ioannem Fabricium</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p8009">Johannes Fabricius (Hans Schmid)</persName>; s. oben <ref target="file11982">Nr. 1935</ref> mit Anm. 5.</note> non tam, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quod tu illum mihi toties commendas,<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> hatte <persName ref="p8009">Johannes Fabricius (Hans Schmid)</persName> in seinen Schreiben vom 21. Mai (oben <ref target="file11963">Nr. 1916</ref>) und 24. Juni (oben <ref target="file11982">Nr. 1935</ref>) empfohlen.</note> quam quod vi<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>deo non vulgarem in ipso ingenii bonitatem relucere.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Ad literas satis est tardus, sed alioqui bonus et probus, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ac bonitatem illam ingenii praefero acumini.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">F<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>elicissimos autem illos esse iudico, qui utrumque ac<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ceperunt a deo et utrumque excolunt et ornant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Nescio <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>quae nova scripseris, quae nullam apud me <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>fidem invenerunt<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Vgl. oben <ref target="file11982">Nr. 1935</ref>, 14f.</note>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Certe scribuntur tibi et mihi <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>non raro, quae, etsi a certis proficiscantur authoribus, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>non usqueadeo tamen comperta sunt.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Non autem video, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>cur id te male habeat aut quomodo scribas te sentire <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>damnum haud mediocre, posteaquam coeperim no<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>varum rerum cognitionem petere ab aliis.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Novum p<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>rofecto id mihi videtur, si non possum ab aliis nisi <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>tuo damno cognitionem novarum rerum petere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quae <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>de <persName ref="p18538">caesare</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Kaiser <persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> et caesareanorum persequtione scribis,<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Gemeint sind die Verfolgungen in den <placeName ref="l20">Niederlanden</placeName>; s. oben <ref target="file11982">Nr. 1935</ref>, 17f.</note> iam olim <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>invenerunt apud me fidem.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Scivi enim iam olim <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>caesarem iuratum esse hostem Christi.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Quoniam vero et <persName ref="p20225">Gallus</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">König <persName ref="p20225">Franz I.</persName></note> <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Christum persequitur, ideo nebulones sanguinarii mutuis <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>sese bellis atterunt.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Interea <persName ref="p19042">Barbarossa</persName>, <persName ref="p18593">Turcici <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>imperatoris</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Sultan <persName ref="p18593">Suleiman I.</persName></note> et exercitus aut classis potius barbarae <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>dux, circa principium iunii <placeName ref="l2088">Thelamonem</placeName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><placeName ref="l2088">Talamone</placeName>, an einer kleinen Landspitze südlich von <placeName ref="l2090">Grosseto</placeName> nahe der <placeName ref="l3256">Maremma</placeName> gelegen.</note>, portum <lb xml:id="p1z32"/><placeName ref="l462">Senensium</placeName>, oppugnavit, coepit<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Hier und weiter unten als</hi> cepit <hi>zu verstehen.</hi></note> et exussit arcem et<pb type="edition" next="307"/> urbem.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Coepit item et exussit vicinas; imminet <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>iam <placeName ref="l2089">Orbitello</placeName>,<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Neben</hi> iam <placeName ref="l2089">Orbitello</placeName> <hi>bis</hi> ne et in <hi>am Rande:</hi> 15. Iunii.</note><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><placeName ref="l2089">Orbetello</placeName>, Ort in der <placeName ref="l778">Toskana</placeName> auf der Landzunge, die den <placeName ref="l3257">Monte Argentario</placeName> mit dem Festland verbindet; gehörte zu <placeName ref="l462">Siena</placeName>. - Die Ortschaft widerstand.</note> imo <placeName ref="l462">Senenses</placeName> metuunt, ne et in <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>ipsos redundet fluctus ille bellicus<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Die <placeName ref="l2510">türkische</placeName> Flotte befand sich auf dem Rückzug von der <placeName ref="l832">französischen</placeName> Küste, um nach <placeName ref="l1148">Konstantinopel</placeName> zurückzufahren, als sie diese Eroberungen unternahm. <persName ref="p19042">Barbarossa</persName> hatte die <placeName ref="l2685">ligurische</placeName> Küste verschont, aber <placeName ref="l2092">Elba</placeName> geplündert, ehe er <placeName ref="l2088">Talamone</placeName> und <placeName ref="l2089">Orbetello</placeName> angriff; s. <persName ref="p4958">Paulo Giovio</persName>, Historiae sui temporis II/2, Rom 1985. -Opera V, S. 206-208; <bibl source="b152">Cardauns</bibl> 330; <bibl source="b480">PC</bibl> III 524.</note>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Sic autem ex <lb xml:id="p1z36"/><placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> scribunt amici;<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Unbekannt; Brief(e) nicht überliefert.</note> quam vere, ignoro.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Metuo tamen, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>ne nimis <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>vera sint.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Certo enim credo brevi <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>vastandam <placeName ref="l834">Italiam</placeName>, <placeName ref="l832">Galliam</placeName>, <placeName ref="l822">Germaniam</placeName> etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale et ora dominum <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>assidue.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>, 12. iulii anno 1544.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/><persName ref="p495">H. Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>D. <persName ref="p8418">Osvaldo Myconio</persName>, <placeName ref="l28">Basiliensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ecclesiae antistiti, fratri et domino <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>suo colendo.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
